6  | 03/19/2024\nL138: 【62†LENMELDY】\nL139: atidarsagene autotemcel  | Indicated for treatment of children with pre-symptomatic late infantile (PSLI), pre-symptomatic early juvenile (PSEJ) or early symptomatic early juvenile (ESEJ) metachromatic leukodystrophy (MLD).  | 125758/0  | Orchard\nL140: Therapeutics\nL141: (Europe) Limited\nL142: Orchard\nL143: Therapeutics\nL144: North America\nL145: 101 Seaport\nL146: Boulevard, 7th\nL147: Floor\nL148: Boston, MA 02210\nL149: Lic. # 2263  | 03/18/2024\nL150: 【63†Elecsys Anti-HCV II】\nL151: Elecsys Anti-HCV II  | An in vitro immunoassay for the qualitative detection of antibodies to hepatitis C virus (HCV) in human serum and plasma. It is intended to screen individual human donors, including volunteer donors of whole blood, blood components and source plasma. The assay is also intended to be used to screen organ, tissue and cell donors, when donor samples are obtained while the donor's heart is still beating. It is not intended for use on cord blood specimens.  | 125803/0  | Roche Diagnostics\nL152: 9115 Hague Road\nL153: Indianapolis, IN 46250\nL154: Lic. # 2305  | 02/28/2024\nL155: 【64†Elecsys Anti-HBc II】\nL156: Elecsys Anti-HBc II  | An in vitro immunoassay for the qualitative detection of antibodies to hepatitis B core antigen (anti-HBc) in human serum and plasma. It is intended to screen individual human donors, including volunteer donors of whole blood and blood components. The assay is also intended to be used to screen organ, tissue and cell donors, when donor samples are obtained while the donor’s heart is still beating. It is not intended for use on cord blood specimens.  | 125804/0  | Roche Diagnostics\nL157: 9115 Hague Road\nL158: Indianapolis, IN 46250\nL159: Lic. # 2305  | 02/27/2024\nL160: 【65†Elecsys HBsAg II and Elecsys HBsAg II Auto Confirm】\nL161: Elecsys HBsAg II and Elecsys HBsAg II Auto Confirm  | An in vitro immunoassay intended for the qualitative detection of hepatitis B surface antigen (HBsAg) in human serum and plasma. It is intended to screen individual human donors, including volunteer donors of whole blood, blood components and source plasma. The assay is also intended to be used to screen organ, tissue and cell donors, when donor samples are obtained while the donor’s heart is still beating.\nL162: It is not intended for use on cord blood specimens.  | 125802/0  | Roche Diagnostics\nL163: 9115 Hague Road\nL164: Indianapolis, IN 46250\nL165: Lic. # 2305  | 02/21/2024\nL166: 【66†AMTAGVI】\nL167: Lifileucel  | Indicated for treatment of adult patients with unresectable or metastatic melanoma previously treated with a PD-1 blocking antibody, and if BRAF V600 mutation positive, a BRAF inhibitor with or without a MEK inhibitor.  | 125773/0  | Iovance Biotherapeutics, Inc.\nL168: 825 Industrial Road, Suite 400\nL169: San Carlos, CA 94070\nL170: Lic. # 2298  | 02/16/2024\nL171: 【67†Elecsys Chagas】\nL172: Elecsys Chagas  | An in vitro immunoassay for the qualitative detection of antibodies to Trypanosoma cruzi (T. cruzi, the causative agent of the Chagas disease) in human serum and plasma. It’s intended to screen individual human donors, including volunteer donors of whole blood and blood components. The assay is also intended to be used to screen organ, tissue and cell donors, when donor samples are obtained while the donor’s heart is still beating. It is not intended for use on cord blood specimens.\nL173:  | 125799/0  | Roche Diagnostics\nL174: 9115 Hague Road\nL175: Indianapolis, IN 46250\nL176: Lic. # 2305  | 02/05/2024\nL177: Source Plasma  | Indicated for further manufacturing of injectable products.  | 125783/0  | Life Plasma, Inc.\nL178: 5438 Perkiomen Avenue\nL179: Reading, PA 19606\nL180: Lic. # 2311  | 01/30/2024\nL181: Source Plasma  | Indicated for further manufacturing of injectable products.  | 125783/0  | Life Plasma, Inc.\nL182: 5438 Perkiomen Avenue\nL183: Reading, PA 19606\nL184: Lic. # 2311  | 01/30/2024\nL185: 【68†CASGEVY】\nL186: Exagamglo